cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Warmish Web"
type: software
abstract: >-
  Warmish Web is a static, client-side tool for processing radiometric FLIR thermal images
  in the browser, with no upload and no ExifTool. It parses the FLIR APP1 segment, inverts the
  Planck equation to temperatures, renders palettes and visible-image overlays, supports
  rectangular, spot and polygon regions of interest, batch processing with zip export, and
  GPS-based map views. Its numeric core is validated against the original desktop Warmish engine.
